#: 02.md:1
msgid "Tutorial 2: Ensemble refinement with EMMIVox"
msgstr "チュートリアル2：EMMIVox による Ensemble Refinement"

#: 02.md:3
msgid ""
"These are the steps to do ensemble modelling using a cryo-EM map and "
"EMMIVox."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:5
msgid ""
"**Note 1**: To do ensemble modelling you need to first complete the single-"
"structure refinement tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:7
msgid ""
"**Note 2**: all the python scripts are contained in the `scripts` folder. "
"Please run each step of the tutorial in the dedicated subfolder of "
"`tutorials/2-ensemble` referred to as **Working directory**."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:9
msgid "0. Production"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:11
msgid ""
"Prepare the input files and directories for ensemble modelling with 16 "
"replicas using:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:13
msgid "`bash prepare_PLUMED_Ensemble_input.sh 16`"
msgstr "`bash prepare_PLUMED_Ensemble_input.sh 16`"

#: 02.md:15
msgid ""
"You can specify fewer or more replicas depending on the number of CPU cores "
"and GPUs available."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:17
msgid ""
"The generated PLUMED input file, called `plumed_EMMI.dat`, should look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:60
msgid ""
"Run a 10-ns long simulation in parallel using 16 MPI processes, each one "
"parallelized on multiple CPU cores (`$OMP_NUM_THREADS`). You might need to "
"adapt this line depending on your command to submit parallel jobs, i.e. "
"srun, mpiexec, or mpirun."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:63
msgid ""
"`srun -N 16 gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -ntomp $OMP_NUM_THREADS -plumed "
"plumed_EMMI.dat -s production.tpr -multidir rep-* -nsteps 5000000`"
msgstr ""
"`srun -N 16 gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -ntomp $OMP_NUM_THREADS -plumed "
"plumed_EMMI.dat -s production.tpr -multidir rep-* -nsteps 5000000`"

#: 02.md:65
msgid ""
"**Note**: Usually a good setup for multiple-replica simulations is to "
"allocate 1 GPU to each replica, and 6-10 CPU cores (`$OMP_NUM_THREADS`) per "
"replica depending on the system size. You can safely allocate (using your "
"job manager, i.e. slurm or pbs) 2 replicas on the same GPU without "
"significant loss in performance."
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:67
msgid "**Working directory**: `0-Production`"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:69
msgid "1. Postprocessing and validation"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:71
msgid ""
"We first need to concatenate the trajectories of all replicas and fix "
"discontinuities due to Periodic Boundary Conditions:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:73
msgid "`bash prepare_PLUMED_Ensemble_analysis.sh`"
msgstr "`bash prepare_PLUMED_Ensemble_analysis.sh`"

#: 02.md:75
msgid ""
"Now we need to transform back the concatenated trajectory `traj-all-PBC.xtc`"
" to fit the original cryo-EM map using the `transformation.dat` created "
"during the map preparation stage of single-structure refinement:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:78
msgid ""
"`python align-XTC.py conf_map.pdb traj-all-PBC.xtc traj-all-PBC-align.xtc "
"../../1-refinement/1-Map-Preparation/transformation.dat`"
msgstr ""
"`python align-XTC.py conf_map.pdb traj-all-PBC.xtc traj-all-PBC-align.xtc "
"../../1-refinement/1-Map-Preparation/transformation.dat`"

#: 02.md:80
msgid ""
"We add a Bfactor column to the reference PDB (`conf_map.pdb`). These "
"Bfactors are the same for all residues, they were set before doing ensemble "
"modelling equal to the minimum Bfactor found in the single-structure "
"refinement:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:83
msgid ""
"`python add-BFACT.py conf_map.pdb ../0-Production/EMMIStatus "
"conf_EMMIVOX.pdb`"
msgstr ""
"`python add-BFACT.py conf_map.pdb ../0-Production/EMMIStatus "
"conf_EMMIVOX.pdb`"

#: 02.md:85
msgid ""
"And finally we calculate model fit to the data (CC_mask) of the original PDB"
" `7P6A.pdb` and of our ensemble:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:87
msgid ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map --pdbA=../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/7P6A.pdb --pdbC=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --trjC=traj-all-PBC-align.xtc "
"--threshold=0.0`"
msgstr ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map --pdbA=../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/7P6A.pdb --pdbC=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --trjC=traj-all-PBC-align.xtc "
"--threshold=0.0`"

#: 02.md:89
msgid ""
"**Note**: if you performed energy minimization and validation after single-"
"structure refinement, you can compare also with the EMMIVOX model:"
msgstr ""

#: 02.md:91
msgid ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=../../1-refinement/5-Analysis/conf_EMMIVOX.pdb "
"--pdbC=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --trjC=traj-all-PBC-align.xtc --threshold=0.0`"
msgstr ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../../1-refinement/1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=../../1-refinement/5-Analysis/conf_EMMIVOX.pdb "
"--pdbC=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --trjC=traj-all-PBC-align.xtc --threshold=0.0`"

#: 02.md:93
msgid "**Working directory**: `1-Analysis`"
msgstr ""

